{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"曾国藩·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"zeng-guofan","categoryLabel":"曾国藩","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/27_zeng-guofan/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"曾国藩-思想与方法\">曾国藩·思想与方法</h1><p>本 hub（思想与方法）回答一个问题：<strong>曾国藩（1811—1872）究竟靠哪一套可拆解、可学习的&quot;方法&quot;，把一个自认资质平庸的湖南寒门子弟，做成了修身楷模、中兴名臣与一代用人大家？</strong> 它不讲他做了什么大事（那是兄弟 hub 的职责），而专讲他<strong>怎么想、怎么做</strong>——把&quot;修身、处世、领导&quot;三层功夫各自还原成可操作的机制、规程与权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>曾国藩系列共六个 hub，本 hub 是其中的&quot;方法论内核&quot;，与其余五个明确分工、互不重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1·生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的人生轨迹是怎样的</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 方法的<strong>事件背景</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2·核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他留下了什么贡献</td>\n<td>本 hub 的方法是其&quot;修身楷模/经世/齐家&quot;贡献的<strong>内在机理</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3·思想与方法（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他怎么想、怎么做</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4·主要著作</a></td>\n<td>这些思想写在哪</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 方法的<strong>文本载体</strong>（家书、日记）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5·影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这套方法影响了谁</td>\n<td>本 hub 方法的<strong>下游效应与当代应用</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6·争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>该如何公允评价他</td>\n<td>对本 hub 方法（尤其&quot;诚&quot;与酷烈手段）的<strong>批判性审视</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>事功看 1/2，文本看 4，影响看 5，批判看 6，而&quot;心法与打法&quot;看本 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构-一种功夫-三个半径\">三章结构：一种功夫，三个半径</h2><p>本 hub 的三章不是三种并列的本事，而是<strong>同一套&quot;严于律己&quot;的功夫向外展开的三个半径</strong>——对自己（修身）→ 对世事（处世）→ 对他人（领导）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>半径</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"the-way-of-cultivation/\">1·修身之道</a></td>\n<td>对自己</td>\n<td>每日省察（日课十二条）、诚/敬/慎独</td>\n<td>用可核对的纪律把自己逼成想成为的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"worldly-wisdom/\">2·处世智慧</a></td>\n<td>对世事</td>\n<td>勤与谦、结硬寨打呆仗（尚拙）</td>\n<td>以勤成事、以谦保身、以拙稳赢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"the-art-of-leadership/\">3·领导艺术</a></td>\n<td>对他人</td>\n<td>知人善任、以身作则</td>\n<td>先立住自己，再带好别人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;修身&lt;br/&gt;对自己&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;处世&lt;br/&gt;对世事&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;领导&lt;br/&gt;对他人&quot;]&#10;    A -.根基.-&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"修身&lt;br/&gt;对自己\"] --&gt; B[\"处世&lt;br/&gt;对世事\"] --&gt; C[\"领导&lt;br/&gt;对他人\"]\n    A -.根基.-&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解曾国藩所处的太平天国乱局与他的人生分期，否则本 hub 中的&quot;裁撤湘军&quot;&quot;结硬寨打呆仗&quot;等会缺少背景。</li>\n<li><strong>建议顺序</strong>：按 1→2→3 顺序读，因为后一章以前一章为前提——处世的&quot;勤谦/尚拙&quot;是修身价值观的外化，领导的&quot;以身作则&quot;更直接以&quot;严于律己&quot;为根。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完本 hub，若想看这些方法的<strong>原始文本</strong>，转 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>；若想看它们在今天的<strong>应用与争议</strong>，转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一条批判性提醒\">一条批判性提醒</h2><p>本 hub 力求不做&quot;成功学式&quot;的单向赞美。曾国藩的&quot;诚&quot;是否表演化、&quot;以德服人&quot;如何与其镇压的酷烈手段（&quot;曾剃头&quot;）并存，都是真实存在的张力。读其方法时，请同时带着 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 的眼光——一套有效的方法论，不等于一套无代价、无争议的方法论。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-way-of-cultivation","title":"The Way Of Cultivation","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"daily-self-examination","title":"每日的省察","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation/daily-self-examination"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sincerity-and-reverence","title":"诚与敬","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-way-of-cultivation/sincerity-and-reverence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"worldly-wisdom","title":"Worldly Wisdom","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diligence-and-prudence","title":"勤与谦","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom/diligence-and-prudence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"steadiness-and-endurance","title":"结硬寨打呆仗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom/steadiness-and-endurance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-art-of-leadership","title":"The Art Of Leadership","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recognizing-talent","title":"知人善任","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership/recognizing-talent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"leading-by-example","title":"以身作则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership/leading-by-example"}]}]}